@url = http://localhost:3000/api

### List
GET {{url}}/timesheets
X-Contractor-Id: 1

### Detail
GET {{url}}/timesheets/1
X-Contractor-Id: 1

### Not found
GET {{url}}/timesheets/999
X-Contractor-Id: 1

### Create (valid)
POST {{url}}/timesheets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Contractor-Id: 1

{
  "weekEndingDate": "2026-09-27",
  "comment": "Test week",
  "entries": [
    { "workDate": "2026-09-21", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-22", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-23", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-24", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-25", "hours": 4 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-26", "hours": 0 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-27", "hours": 0 }
  ]
}

### Duplicate - run the one above twice, expect 409

### Negative hours - expect 400
POST {{url}}/timesheets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Contractor-Id: 1

{
  "weekEndingDate": "2026-10-04",
  "entries": [
    { "workDate": "2026-09-28", "hours": -5 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-29", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-30", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-10-01", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-10-02", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-10-03", "hours": 0 },
    { "workDate": "2026-10-04", "hours": 0 }
  ]
}

### Submit
POST {{url}}/timesheets/2/submit
X-Contractor-Id: 1

### Edit submitted - expect 409
PUT {{url}}/timesheets/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Contractor-Id: 1

{
  "weekEndingDate": "2026-09-13",
  "entries": [
    { "workDate": "2026-09-07", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-08", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-09", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-10", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-11", "hours": 8 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-12", "hours": 0 },
    { "workDate": "2026-09-13", "hours": 0 }
  ]
}